  message: "SATISFIED at dev 4e8c47e47d (PR #366). The filed repro: hypergumbo_core.scip._generated (and both siblings) no longer appear in the uncatalogued set - unknown is EMPTY on the artifact-scoped self-survey. Fix is the component-bounded INFIX relation in _is_analyzed_module (analyzed src PATHS vs callee IMPORT names across a packaging prefix), NOT a prefix rule - the component-boundary control (core.scip must NOT match hypergumbo-core) is pinned by test_the_suffix_relation_is_component_bounded. Vendored-code reading is coherent: vendored source WAS analyzed, so infix-matching it as first-party is correct."  # 02b3
